.nf
YASMV manual                                                 property

.ti 0
SYNOPSIS

.in 3
property set <name> <expression>
property list

.ti 0
DESCRIPTION

.fi
.in 3
Save a named Boolean safety property. Use check invariant -name NAME to check
it with interpolation, or select BMC or induction with -method and -depth.

Requires a loaded model. set saves a new immutable revision; reusing a name
replaces its expression in that revision. list displays the saved expressions.
Names containing spaces must be quoted. Expressions use native syntax and are
validated when used. These commands preserve the native model and trace.

.ti 0
EXAMPLES

.nf
.in 3
>> property set once !DUPLICATE
>> check invariant -name once -method bmc -depth 12

.ti 0
SEE ALSO

.fi
.in 3
help workspace, help check.
